A topic in kafka is associated with multiple partitions.
All the partitions doesn't reside in the same broker.
There is a leader and follower partitions based on replication factor.
Replication factor decides how many follower partitions will be there.
leader and follower partitions doesn't reside in the same cluster.

kafka distribute partitions among brokers to balance storage and traffic.
Increase throughput.
Fault tolerance.
